 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Explosive Flesh — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You can make your body into a deadly bomb.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you can make any part of you a deadly bomb. You spend cursed energy to remove and throw your body parts. You remove the part as described below. Throwing takes an action:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Attack</th>\n<th></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Cost</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Action</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Effect</th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Tiny(Tooth, Finger, Hair)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">1 CE + Con mod HP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Free action</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">You throw the body part at a point within 120ft. Creatures within 5 ft make a Dex save. On a failure, they take Xd6 force damage. On a success, they take half.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Small(Ears, Nose)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">2 CE + Con mod×half your level HP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Bonus action</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">You throw the body part at a point within 100ft. Creatures within 10 ft make a Dex save. On a failure, they take Xd8 force damage and are knocked prone. On a success they take half.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Medium(Hands, Feet)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">4 CE + Con mod×level HP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Action</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">You throw the body part at a point within 80ft. Creatures within 15 ft make a Dex save. On a failure, they take Xd10 force damage and are knocked prone. On a success, they take half.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Large(Arms, Legs)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">6 CE + Con mod×level HP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Full Turn Action</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">You throw the body part at a point within 60ft. Creatures within 20 ft make a Dex save. On a failure, they take Xd12 force damage and are knocked prone. On a success, they take half.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>After using a limb or body part in an explosion, it will be considered removed (Con mod is treated as min of 1).<br />\nThe X is your CE modifier. Damage from this technique deals twice as much damage to objects and structures.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
